{"id":"n81192-1-7","stage":2,"title":"쿨쿨 · 呼呼","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81192-1-7-1","ko":"네 형은 어디 있니?","zh":"你哥哥在哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형은","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥，哥哥","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/be0e43847010fc740c36.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81192-1-7-2","ko":"방에서 세상모르고 쿨쿨 자고 있어요.","zh":"他在房间里睡得正香，什么都不知道呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방에서","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세상모르고","meaning":"根本，一点也；不知不觉","explanation":"세상：根本，一点也；모르다：不知不觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"},{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"8","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"8","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쿨쿨","meaning":"呼呼","explanation":"쿨쿨：呼呼","readings":[{"term":"쿨쿨","audio":"/audio/ce7bdeae2e3b87a40616.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81192","senseId":"1","lemma":"쿨쿨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자고","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"根本，一点也","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"全然，一点儿都。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知不觉","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"在无意中不自觉地做出某种行为或说出某种话。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"ce7bdeae2e3b87a4","term":"쿨쿨","zh":"呼呼","audio":"/audio/ce7bdeae2e3b87a40616.mp3","entryId":"81192","definition":"熟睡而深呼吸的声音；或指其模样。","pronunciation":["쿨쿨"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/58f7dcd7a34b646162fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.078,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81192","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9047,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他在房间里睡得正香，什么都不知道呢。","你哥哥在哪儿？","你是姐姐，让着点比你小的孩子吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你哥哥在哪儿？","你是姐姐，让着点比你小的孩子吧。","他在房间里睡得正香，什么都不知道呢。"],"answer":2}]}
